            "short": "$\\dfrac{-33x-6}{-12}$",
            "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\dfrac{11x+2}{4}&=\\dfrac{-3(11x+2)}{4(-3)}\\\\&=\\dfrac{-33x-6}{-12}\\end{aligned}$$",
            "provenance": {
